{"id":"6b5b4d9209f24056","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-scott-continuity.md","title":"有向上确界保持与Scott连续性","display":"df-scott-continuity — 有向上确界保持与Scott连续性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-scott-continuity","aliases":["72-df-scott-continuity"],"display":"df-scott-continuity — 有向上确界保持与Scott连续性","depends_on":["[[72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X §3.10 print750/PDF762 (continuity of the product-type operator); local explicit general Scott-continuity interface","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local well-definedness argument recorded","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22","revision_2026_10_22":"本轮新增节点保守记录为尚未完成完整依赖资格认证"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-scott-continuity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-scott-continuity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-scott-continuity — 有向上确界保持与Scott连续性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d95b8963194821b\" href=\"?note=5d95b8963194821b\" title=\"72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration\">72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X §3.10 print750/PDF762 (continuity of the product-type operator); local explicit general Scott-continuity interface"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local well-definedness argument recorded"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"本轮新增节点保守记录为尚未完成完整依赖资格认证"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PCPO}(D,\\preceq,b)\">\\(\\operatorname{PCPO}(D,\\preceq,b)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:D\\to D\">\\(F:D\\to D\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Directed},\\operatorname{Sup},\\bigsqcup_{D,\\preceq}\">\\(\\operatorname{Directed},\\operatorname{Sup},\\bigsqcup_{D,\\preceq}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d95b8963194821b\" href=\"?note=5d95b8963194821b\" title=\"72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration\">72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration</a>。</li>\n<li>下式通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sup}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sup}\\)</span> 关系表达上确界保持；该关系对任意子集均有确定真值。单调性使非空有向集的像也非空有向。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Mon}_{D,\\preceq}(F)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x,y\\in D\\ (x\\preceq y\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ F(x)\\preceq F(y)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Scott}_{D,\\preceq}(F)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Mon}_{D,\\preceq}(F)\\land\n\\forall S\\subseteq D\\ \\forall z\\in D\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{Directed}(S;D,\\preceq)\\land\\operatorname{Sup}(z,S;D,\\preceq)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Sup}(F(z),F[S];D,\\preceq)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Mon}_{D,\\preceq}(F)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x,y\\in D\\ (x\\preceq y\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ F(x)\\preceq F(y)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Scott}_{D,\\preceq}(F)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Mon}_{D,\\preceq}(F)\\land\n\\forall S\\subseteq D\\ \\forall z\\in D\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{Directed}(S;D,\\preceq)\\land\\operatorname{Sup}(z,S;D,\\preceq)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Sup}(F(z),F[S];D,\\preceq)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>连续性比单调性增加了有向上确界交换条件；它不要求保存空集的上确界，因此连续函数可以不严格保持底。类型语义里用到的不同连续性约定需分别声明；本节点采用通常的非空有向版本。原目录已有一般单调不动点定理，但没有这一可供Kleene定理调用的精确接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"5d95b8963194821b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"5d95b8963194821b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PCPO}(D,\\preceq,b)$，$F:D\\to D$；$\\operatorname{Directed},\\operatorname{Sup},\\bigsqcup_{D,\\preceq}$ 取 [[72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{PCPO}(D,\\preceq,b)","display":false},{"tex":"F:D\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Directed},\\operatorname{Sup},\\bigsqcup_{D,\\preceq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sup}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Mon}_{D,\\preceq}(F)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x,y\\in D\\ (x\\preceq y\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ F(x)\\preceq F(y)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Scott}_{D,\\preceq}(F)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Mon}_{D,\\preceq}(F)\\land\n\\forall S\\subseteq D\\ \\forall z\\in D\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{Directed}(S;D,\\preceq)\\land\\operatorname{Sup}(z,S;D,\\preceq)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Sup}(F(z),F[S];D,\\preceq)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2064,"backlinks":[{"id":"2a71248c57bfde0f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-471","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-scott-continuity|df-scott-continuity — 有向上确界保持与Scott连续性]]"},{"id":"c3d353f164230c6a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal D$ 非空且按包含关系有向；$\\operatorname{Scott}$ 使用 [[72-df-scott-continuity]]。"},{"id":"48f27dd0a6718192","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PCPO}(D,\\preceq,b)$、$F:D\\to D$，且 $\\operatorname{Scott}_{D,\\preceq}(F)$，见 [[72-df-scott-continuity]]。"}],"outgoing":["5d95b8963194821b"]}